{"time": "28000", "image": "engenn10le02ob04re2img03.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Reporter</span>: Got it. So what's the best thing about baseball, in your opinion?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Tip</span>: The best thing about baseball is that it's a meritocracy. You can't fake the stats. If you get a hit 30% of the time, you're a star. If you get a hit 25% of the time, you're a bum. And they can measure this stuff with high levels of accuracy.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Reporter</span>: Sounds like you're talking about the modern day batting statistics.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Tip</span>: Exactly. It gives everything we do a legitimacy, because we can measure our value in so many different ways.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Reporter</span>: How have things changed in the game?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Tip</span>: Well you know baseball didn't allow minorities to play for a long time, so that was a huge black mark on the game. It took a lot of advocacy to change people's attitudes. Especially the old-fashioned owners.", "id": 2}, {"time": "79000", "image": "engenn10le02ob04re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Reporter</span>: Must have changed in a number of smaller ways as well, I imagine.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Tip</span>: Yeah. Chewing tobacco used to be considered a delicacy in the dugout. Now it's frowned upon due to the health risks.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Reporter</span>: So it was the power of the people. A real democracy.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Tip</span>: Baseball is not a democracy. The manager is in charge, and he's usually a bad-tempered old curmudgeon.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Reporter</span>: Ever thought about managing?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Tip</span>: Of course, I have to think about my legacy. Wait, are you calling me a bad-tempered old curmudgeon? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Reporter</span>: Not at all, you're more of a bad-tempered young curmudgeon.", "id": 3}], "audiosrc": "engenn10le02ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le02ob04re2img01.jpg"}}], "id": 1}]}]}